        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "3706c396-7307-5077-ab82-106296c6da86",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alexander Young, George Young, Malcolm Young, Angus Young, Stephen Young, Stevie Young\n- Bands: Easybeats, AC/DC\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, saxophonist, bassist, guitarist, session musician, rhythm guitarist, backing vocalist\n\nFacts:\n- Alexander Young was born on 28 December 1938 and died on 4 August 1997.\n- Alexander Young, also known as George Alexander, was a Scottish singer, songwriter, saxophonist, bassist, guitarist, and session musician.\n- Stephen Crawford Young was born on 11 December 1956 in Glasgow, Scotland.\n- Alexander Young was the elder brother of George Young, Malcolm Young, and Angus Young.\n- George Young was the rhythm guitarist and a founding member of the Easybeats.\n- Malcolm Young and Angus Young were founding members of AC/DC.\n- Alexander Young was the younger brother of Stephen Young.\n- Stephen Young was the father of Stevie Young.\n- Stevie Young is a Scottish musician and the rhythm guitarist and backing vocalist for AC/DC.",
